{"id":"d4b3c83a7ffb542c","group":"28","path":"28/28-df-distributional-problem.md","title":"df-distributional-problem","display":"df-distributional-problem","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Computational Complexity: A Modern Approach","book_abbrev":"28","label":"28-df-distributional-problem","aliases":["28-df-distributional-problem"],"display":"df-distributional-problem","depends_on":["[[28-df-ppt]]"],"source_book_location":"Definition 18.1; printed p.362; PDF p.388","source_printed_pages":"362","source_pdf_pages":"388","source_status":"statement-checked"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Computational Complexity: A Modern Approach"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"28"},{"key":"label","html":"28-df-distributional-problem"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>28-df-distributional-problem</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-distributional-problem"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"b75200f005282ddf\" href=\"?note=b75200f005282ddf\" title=\"28-df-ppt\">28-df-ppt</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_book_location","html":"Definition 18.1; printed p.362; PDF p.388"},{"key":"source_printed_pages","html":"362"},{"key":"source_pdf_pages","html":"388"},{"key":"source_status","html":"statement-checked"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Sigma=\\{0,1\\}\">\\(\\Sigma=\\{0,1\\}\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Dist}\">\\(\\operatorname{Dist}\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"b75200f005282ddf\" href=\"?note=b75200f005282ddf\" title=\"28-df-ppt\">28-df-ppt</a>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathfrak D\">\\(\\mathfrak D\\)</span> 为按精确输入长度索引的分布族集合，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{DistProblem}\">\\(\\operatorname{DistProblem}\\)</span> 为分布式判定问题集合。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathfrak D\\coloneqq\\{(D_n)_{n\\in\\mathbb N}:\\forall n\\in\\mathbb N\\;D_n\\in\\operatorname{Dist}(\\Sigma^n)\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathfrak D\\coloneqq\\{(D_n)_{n\\in\\mathbb N}:\\forall n\\in\\mathbb N\\;D_n\\in\\operatorname{Dist}(\\Sigma^n)\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{DistProblem}\\coloneqq\\{\\langle L,D\\rangle:L\\subseteq\\Sigma^*\\land D\\in\\mathfrak D\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{DistProblem}\\coloneqq\\{\\langle L,D\\rangle:L\\subseteq\\Sigma^*\\land D\\in\\mathfrak D\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>定义 18.1 本身不限制分布可采样或可计算；这些限制在 distNP 的具体定义中另加。新增的查找范围是本书 28 目录全部原子名及 MOC，未发现兼容既有定义；平均时间节点实际复用本接口。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"28-df-ppt","status":"resolved","id":"b75200f005282ddf","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[28-df-ppt]]","embed":false},{"target":"28-df-ppt","status":"resolved","id":"b75200f005282ddf","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\Sigma=\\{0,1\\}$；$\\operatorname{Dist}$ 见 [[28-df-ppt]]。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"\\Sigma=\\{0,1\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Dist}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathfrak D","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{DistProblem}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathfrak D\\coloneqq\\{(D_n)_{n\\in\\mathbb N}:\\forall n\\in\\mathbb N\\;D_n\\in\\operatorname{Dist}(\\Sigma^n)\\}.","display":true},{"tex":"\\operatorname{DistProblem}\\coloneqq\\{\\langle L,D\\rangle:L\\subseteq\\Sigma^*\\land D\\in\\mathfrak D\\}.","display":true}],"bytes":1124,"backlinks":[{"id":"c2ed46051194e5ee","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":3,"excerpt":"$\\Sigma=\\{0,1\\}$；$\\langle L,D\\rangle\\in\\operatorname{DistProblem}$，见 [[28-df-distributional-problem]]；$\\chi_L:\\Sigma^*\\to\\{0,1\\}$ 见 [[28-df-characteristic-language]]，单比特输出串与相应的 0、1 认同。"},{"id":"2a9600026c66a6d0","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\operatorname{DistProblem}$ 见 [[28-df-distributional-problem]]；$\\mathbf{NP}$ 见 [[28-df-np]]；$\\operatorname{PComp}$ 见 [[28-df-p-computable-distribution]]。"},{"id":"8ad248c715bc0bb7","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\langle L,D\\rangle,\\langle L',D'\\rangle\\in\\operatorname{DistProblem}$ 见 [[28-df-distributional-problem]]；$\\mathbf{FP}$ 见 [[28-df-polynomial-time-function]]。"},{"id":"bc3e8ddddac2bb74","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$D=(D_n)\\in\\mathfrak D$ 见 [[28-df-distributional-problem]]；$D_n(x)$ 为x概率，$\\le_{\\mathrm{lex}}$ 为同长度字典序。"},{"id":"bc8a45866957835d","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$D\\in\\mathfrak D$ 见 [[28-df-distributional-problem]]；$\\mathbf{FP}$ 见 [[28-df-polynomial-time-function]]，$p\\in\\mathbb N[t]$。"},{"id":"61dee9752dab3b61","anchor":"ref-223","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"第18章：平均情形复杂性：[[28-df-distributional-problem]]、[[28-df-average-polynomial-time]]。"}],"outgoing":["b75200f005282ddf"]}